  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Position and displacement"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "We fix an origin and a positive direction on a line. Position x is measured from the origin. Displacement is the change in position, $\\Delta x = x_2 - x_1$, and has a sign. Path length is the total distance travelled and is never negative.",
    "kn": "ಮೂಲಬಿಂದು ಮತ್ತು ಧನ ದಿಕ್ಕನ್ನು ಗೊತ್ತುಪಡಿಸುತ್ತೇವೆ. ಸ್ಥಾನಪಲ್ಲಟ ಎಂದರೆ ಸ್ಥಾನದ ಬದಲಾವಣೆ. ಪಥದ ಉದ್ದ ಎಂದರೆ ಒಟ್ಟು ಸಾಗಿದ ದೂರ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Displacement can be zero, path length cannot (if the body moved)"
    },
    {
     "en": "|displacement| ≤ path length"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "We fix an origin and a positive direction on a line. Position x is measured from the origin. Displacement is the change in position, $\\Delta x = x_2 - x_1$, and has a sign. Path length is the total distance travelled and is never negative.",
    "kn": "ಮೂಲಬಿಂದು ಮತ್ತು ಧನ ದಿಕ್ಕನ್ನು ಗೊತ್ತುಪಡಿಸುತ್ತೇವೆ. ಸ್ಥಾನಪಲ್ಲಟ ಎಂದರೆ ಸ್ಥಾನದ ಬದಲಾವಣೆ. ಪಥದ ಉದ್ದ ಎಂದರೆ ಒಟ್ಟು ಸಾಗಿದ ದೂರ."
   },
   "formula": "\\Delta x = x_2 - x_1"
  },
